# ddsonic: provenance of the tracked go-librespot replacement (third_party/go-librespot).
# The base is the upstream module, authenticated by its go.sum hashes; the active
# tree is the base with the patches below applied in order. active-h1 is the
# module dirhash (h1) of third_party/go-librespot under the base's module path
# and version, computed locally (it is not an upstream hash; base-h1 is, and
# Go authenticates it). The SDK contract gate (make sdk-contract) re-derives all of it.
# docs/ddsonic/upstream.md describes the procedure.
module github.com/devgianlu/go-librespot
base-version v0.9.1
base-h1 h1:cgHB0Qo3GgqBe+8iZ1qw+kPJVp1s0obTlTXMdPsgb0U=
